the NetHack codebase as the variant developers have to reimplement the
fixes, which is causing NetHack to be an inconsistent and
regionally-varying base to work from. (NAO, which is pretty widely
played, has numerous deviations from 3.4.3 at this point, some of which
are bugfixes.) Not even mentioning what needs to be fixed seems to cause
more work for everyone (including the DevTeam when they get the same bug
repeatedly reported in slightly different terms).

At the rate things are going at the moment, if and when the devteam
